  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/langs2/). VERDICT: MIS-PREMISED. 2026-11-01 review at dev 100b6fbb6e: the RAW tree-sitter-objc parse of AFHTTPSessionManager.h / AFURLSessionManager.h does lose every property_declaration (0/4, 0/11, has_error True), but the analyzer never uses the raw tree: _objc_parse_source retries through the WI-lafom rewrite (AF_API_* availability rule) and gets 4/4 and 11/11, has_error False. analyze_objc emits 15 property symbols today and also did with objc.py from 6ac135c868 (the commit at filing time). Default survey output omits them because noise_filter lists objc in _NOISE_PROPERTY_LANGUAGES (WI-tisom, 313eaf8622) - intentional; --include-docs shows them. MECHANISM: raw-grammar parse measured instead of the analyzer path (which applies the WI-lafom availability rewrite); default survey hides objc properties by design (WI-tisom noise filter). SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-gafip. PROPOSED DISPOSITION: close (awaiting owner authorization; status unchanged)."  # 0a66
